---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Formosa Founders House"
	description="舊金山的台灣創業者之家, A Taiwanese Founder House in San Francisco"
>
	<div class="formosa-page">
		<section class="formosa-section">
			<div class="section-container">
				<div class="section-header">
					<h1 class="section-title">Formosa Founders House</h1>
					<p class="section-subtitle">The home and harbor for Taiwanese founders in San Francisco</p>
				</div>

				<div class="content-grid">
					<div class="story-block">
						<h2 class="block-title">What Is This Place / 這是什麼地方</h2>
						<div class="story-content">
							<p class="story-text">
								Formosa Founders House is a hacker house in San Francisco where Taiwanese startup founders live together under one roof. Think of it as a shared home where you don't just get a room — you get direct access to experienced founders, their networks, and the Silicon Valley ecosystem.
							</p>
							<p class="story-text">
								Formosa Founders House 是台灣創業者的 hacker house — 一個實際住在一起的共居空間。你不只是租一個房間，而是加入一個由創業者組成的家，直接連結到矽谷的人脈和資源。
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="vision-block">
						<h2 class="block-title">What We Offer / 我們提供什麼</h2>
						<div class="vision-list">
							<div class="vision-item">
								<span class="vision-icon">🏠</span>
								<p class="vision-text">
									<strong>Live with proven founders</strong> — Your housemates are YC founders and founders backed by 500 Global and other top VCs
									<br>你的室友是 YC 和 500 Global 等頂級 VC 投資的創業者
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="vision-item">
								<span class="vision-icon">🚀</span>
								<p class="vision-text">
									<strong>Learn from those who've done it</strong> — How to fundraise, find your first customers, navigate Silicon Valley
									<br>直接學習如何 fundraise、找客戶、在矽谷生存
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="vision-item">
								<span class="vision-icon">🤝</span>
								<p class="vision-text">
									<strong>Get intros that matter</strong> — Access to investors, advisors, and other founders through your housemates' networks
									<br>透過室友的人脈接觸到投資人和重要資源
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="vision-item">
								<span class="vision-icon">⚡</span>
								<p class="vision-text">
									<strong>Move fast</strong> — What takes others a year to figure out, you'll learn in weeks through daily conversations
									<br>別人花一年摸索的事，你幾週就懂
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="vision-item">
								<span class="vision-icon">🍲</span>
								<p class="vision-text">
									<strong>Feel at home</strong> — Hot pot parties, tea eggs in the fridge, Mid-Autumn BBQ — familiar comfort while building in a foreign country
									<br>火鍋、茶葉蛋、中秋烤肉——在異鄉也有家的感覺
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="story-block">
						<h2 class="block-title">Why It Matters / 為什麼重要</h2>
						<div class="story-content">
							<p class="story-text">
								台灣創業者來舊金山很辛苦。這裡的創業圈子很緊密，但要打進去很難——尤其是語言和文化障礙。
							</p>
							<p class="story-text">
								大部分人花一年以上才搞清楚這裡怎麼運作，燒錢燒時間，還感到孤立無援。
							</p>
							<p class="story-text">
								Formosa House 直接讓你和走過類似的路、或正在走同樣的路的人住在一起。你不需要慢慢 network ——你已經在裡面了。
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="life-block">
						<h2 class="block-title">Daily Life / 日常生活</h2>
						<div class="life-grid">
							<div class="life-card">
								<h3 class="life-title">工作日</h3>
								<p class="life-description">
									各自出門工作或在家 deep work。沒有規定，沒有壓力。
									偶爾在廚房遇到，聊聊最近在做什麼、遇到什麼困難。
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="life-card">
								<h3 class="life-title">晚餐時光</h3>
								<p class="life-description">
									有人煮飯就一起吃，沒人煮就各自解決或一起叫外賣。
									不強制，但總有機會坐下來，聊聊今天發生的事。
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="life-card">
								<h3 class="life-title">週末聚會</h3>
								<p class="life-description">
									有時候會辦個小型聚會，邀請其他在矽谷的台灣創業者。
									分享經驗、互相幫忙、或純粹認識新朋友。
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="life-card">
								<h3 class="life-title">互相支持</h3>
								<p class="life-description">
									Demo day 前幫忙練習、募資時給建議、失落時有人聽你說話。
									不是導師關係，而是同在創業路上的夥伴。
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="community-block">
						<h2 class="block-title">Who Thrives Here / 什麼樣的人會喜歡這裡</h2>
						<div class="value-list">
							<div class="value-item">
								<h3 class="value-title">你正在 Build 東西</h3>
								<p class="value-text">
									創業、開源專案、研究、創作、認真的 side project——我們歡迎所有 builders。
									我們看重的是你的熱情和你正在做的事，而不是你的 title 或背景。
									如果你有想法、有作品、有原型，我們很想認識你。
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="value-item">
								<h3 class="value-title">你對自己有期待</h3>
								<p class="value-text">
									你知道自己要什麼，也願意為此努力。
									你是自我驅動的——不需要別人督促，因為你本來就熱愛你在做的事。
									我們一起創造一個充滿能量和動力的環境。
								</p>
							</div>
							<div class="value-item">
								<h3 class="value-title">你相信互相幫助</h3>
								<p class="value-text">
									這個社群的魔力來自於每個人的付出與分享。
									煮飯、辦活動、介紹人脈、分享經驗——當你有能力的時候，自然會想要回饋。
									我們相信 pay it forward，讓這個家越來越好。
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="cta-block">
						<h2 class="block-title">Want to Join? / 想加入嗎？</h2>
						<p class="block-text">
							如果你符合上面的描述，而且是台灣創業者，正在或即將來舊金山，
							歡迎填寫表單讓我們認識你。我們會跟你聊聊，看看彼此是否適合。
						</p>
						<div class="cta-links">
							<a href="https://forms.gle/Mk6ZZzWXZJZMMeNW7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-link primary">填寫申請表單 →</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.formosa-page {
		min-height: 100vh;
		background: #000;
	}

	.formosa-section {
		min-height: 100vh;
		background: #000;
		color: #fff;
		padding: 6rem 2rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.section-container {
		max-width: 1400px;
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 3rem;
	}

	.section-header {
		margin-bottom: 5rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;
		padding-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
		font-weight: 300;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		line-height: 1.1;
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
		color: #fff;
	}

	.section-subtitle {
		font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
		font-weight: 300;
		color: #fff;
		margin: 0;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.content-grid {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.block-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
		color: #fff;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.block-text {
		font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.8vw, 1.375rem);
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: #fff;
		opacity: 1;
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 800px;
		font-weight: 300;
	}

	.block-text.disclaimer {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.6vw, 1.125rem);
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.story-block {
		padding: 3rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
	}

	.story-content {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}

	.story-text {
		font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.8vw, 1.375rem);
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: #fff;
		opacity: 1;
		margin: 0;
		font-weight: 300;
	}

	.vision-block {
		padding: 3rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
	}

	.vision-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.vision-item {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.vision-icon {
		font-size: 2rem;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.vision-text {
		font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.8vw, 1.375rem);
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #fff;
		opacity: 1;
		margin: 0;
		font-weight: 300;
	}

	.life-block {
		padding: 3rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
	}

	.life-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.life-card {
		background: #000;
		border: 1px solid #fff;
		padding: 2rem;
		transition: background-color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.life-card:hover {
		background: #fff;
		border-color: #000;
	}

	.life-card:hover .life-title,
	.life-card:hover .life-description {
		color: #000;
	}

	.life-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.8vw, 1.375rem);
		font-weight: 600;
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
		color: #fff;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.life-description {
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.125rem);
		line-height: 1.9;
		color: #fff;
		opacity: 1;
		margin: 0;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
		font-weight: 300;
	}

	.community-block {
		padding: 3rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
	}

	.value-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2.5rem;
	}

	.value-item {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.value-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
		font-weight: 600;
		margin: 0;
		color: #fff;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}

	.value-text {
		font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.6vw, 1.1875rem);
		line-height: 2;
		color: #fff;
		opacity: 1;
		margin: 0;
		font-weight: 300;
	}

	.cta-block {
		padding: 3rem 0;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.cta-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 2rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.contact-link {
		display: inline-block;
		color: #fff;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 500;
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;
		padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
		transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
	}

	.contact-link.primary {
		background: #fff;
		color: #000;
		border: 2px solid #fff;
		padding: 1rem 2rem;
		border-radius: 0;
		opacity: 1;
		transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
	}

	.contact-link.primary:hover {
		background: #000;
		color: #fff;
		transform: translateX(8px);
	}

	.contact-link:hover {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateX(8px);
	}

	@media (max-width: 1024px) {
		.formosa-section {
			padding: 5rem 2rem;
		}

		.section-container {
			padding: 0 2rem;
		}

		.life-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.formosa-section {
			padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
		}

		.section-container {
			padding: 0 1rem;
		}

		.section-header {
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}

		.content-grid {
			gap: 2.5rem;
		}

		.life-card {
			padding: 1.5rem;
		}

		.vision-item {
			gap: 1rem;
		}

		.vision-icon {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
		}

		.story-block,
		.vision-block,
		.life-block,
		.community-block {
			padding: 2rem 0;
		}
	}
</style>
